{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\OpenRouterConnector\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "implements-consumable",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Exception/OpenRouterApiException.php:21 OCA\\OpenRouterConnector\\Exception\\OpenRouterApiException extends OCP\\TaskProcessing\\Exception\\UserFacingProcessingException"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 class implements or extends what the public API marks #[Consumable] in a major of Nextcloud 34: an app calls it, and the server may add a method to it in any release, which breaks a class that implements it.",
        "  lib/Exception/OpenRouterApiException.php:21 OCA\\OpenRouterConnector\\Exception\\OpenRouterApiException extends OCP\\TaskProcessing\\Exception\\UserFacingProcessingException"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "psalm/phar, phpunit/phpunit are in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/SettingsService.php:56 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteKey(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 34. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Service/SettingsService.php:56 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteKey(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig"
      ]
    },
